+/*
+ * USB hotplug notification is disabled in this build.
+ *
+ * The scanner is reached over the network and the SANE backend is configured
+ * --without-usb, so no USB device can ever reach this daemon. libusb still had
+ * to initialise for the notifier alone, and on macOS 26 its darwin backend
+ * leaves a null method table, so libusb_init_context dereferences null and the
+ * daemon dies before it serves anything. Network changes, which are the events
+ * that actually matter here, are still delivered by NetworkHotplugNotifier.
+ *
+ * The class and its interface are unchanged so callers need no edit.
+ */
